                        ],
                        "form": "die Hungerlöhne"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "baec712e-883f-3d4c-b8d6-4e6a3d1518d6",
                        "entry_id": "99f7a409-ff47-3daf-8558-493faaef2c44",
                        "glosses": [
                            "äußerst geringer Lohn"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "b1a97fd1-3e15-4a24-92e9-15488ba2e117",
                                "sense_id": "baec712e-883f-3d4c-b8d6-4e6a3d1518d6",
                                "text": "Er erhielt für seine Tätigkeit nur einen Hungerlohn."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "3d0c9bc5-472e-44c5-a634-178676afe463",
                                "sense_id": "baec712e-883f-3d4c-b8d6-4e6a3d1518d6",
                                "text": "„Und auch das ließ sich leicht bewerkstelligen, denn auf einer armen Insel gibt es natürlich jede Menge Arme, die bereit sind, für einen Hungerlohn zu schuften.“"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "28213e73-f3d0-42dc-b0f2-db3ec2a71deb",
                                "sense_id": "baec712e-883f-3d4c-b8d6-4e6a3d1518d6",
                                "text": "„Sie träumt davon, irgendwann ihr eigenes Hotel zu eröffnen und nicht mehr auf den Hungerlohn angewiesen zu sein, den ihr der Hotelbesitzer zahlt.“"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "8ecb92e0-f649-41f9-a5f3-0690e940ba21",
                                "sense_id": "baec712e-883f-3d4c-b8d6-4e6a3d1518d6",
                                "text": "„Er bekommt einen Hungerlohn, aber wenigstens wird er bezahlt.“"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "6cfb19eb-1cdb-4d05-b6e0-296dfc9be3f7",
                                "sense_id": "baec712e-883f-3d4c-b8d6-4e6a3d1518d6",
                                "text": "„Aber er hatte ja auch Vorteile davon: Er bekam billige Arbeitskräfte, wurde bekocht und konnte sein Personal mit einem Hungerlohn abspeisen.“"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ebec3024-64e5-4670-a92f-38d913556756",
                                "sense_id": "baec712e-883f-3d4c-b8d6-4e6a3d1518d6",
                                "text": "„Tägliche Arbeitszeiten von 14 Stunden für einen Hungerlohn waren keine Seltenheit.“"
                            }
                        ],
                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "31e01982-c20c-430e-b0ac-a76bd6473bd9",
                        "source_entry_id": "99f7a409-ff47-3daf-8558-493faaef2c44",
                        "source_sense_id": "baec712e-883f-3d4c-b8d6-4e6a3d1518d6",
                        "source_sense_description": "äußerst geringer Lohn",
                        "target_lang_word": "pittance",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "pittance",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0e6cb6a9-a955-3911-855a-6d6a90e87172",
                                        "entry_id": "a637121b-2925-315d-b5f1-d744733c432a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A small allowance of food and drink; a scanty meal."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "227bc37d-ad5b-3963-8503-b17ba46fb10b",
                                        "entry_id": "a637121b-2925-315d-b5f1-d744733c432a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A meagre allowance of money or wages."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3e41eacf-f22e-47c4-8b9a-0e801fb659b4",
                                                "sense_id": "227bc37d-ad5b-3963-8503-b17ba46fb10b",
                                                "text": "In the very prime of life, Mr. Glentworth found every prospect gone; he had only a meagre pittance, compared to his former expenditure; but he had neither the habits nor the opportunity of increasing it."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8614b5f1-1b10-4110-ad6b-79e4a0cb85be",
                                                "sense_id": "227bc37d-ad5b-3963-8503-b17ba46fb10b",
                                                "text": "So I went to keep house with him at the Why Not? and my aunt sent down my bag of clothes, and would have made over to Elzevir the pittance that my father left for my keep, but he said it was not needful, and he would have none of it."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9abea35c-fc06-4e4e-8d10-01c64a0759a5",
                                                "sense_id": "227bc37d-ad5b-3963-8503-b17ba46fb10b",
                                                "text": "Dad was forced to claim benefit money from the government. It was a pittance, barely enough to live on."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "03a964e6-ca18-36c2-abf3-39c2a7b8230e",
                                        "entry_id": "a637121b-2925-315d-b5f1-d744733c432a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A small amount."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f4cd61cb-ad10-4323-acc2-788c69a451aa",
                                                "sense_id": "03a964e6-ca18-36c2-abf3-39c2a7b8230e",
                                                "text": "The former residents of Fraguas, who sold up for a pittance, have swung behind the resettlement, happy to see life return to the narrow lanes where they grew up."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "1c9f6341-eef8-4488-9973-07f4228be9f9",
                        "source_entry_id": "99f7a409-ff47-3daf-8558-493faaef2c44",
                        "source_sense_id": "baec712e-883f-3d4c-b8d6-4e6a3d1518d6",
                        "source_sense_description": "äußerst geringer Lohn",
                        "target_lang_word": "salaire de famine",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "salaire de famine",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "83891fcb-a408-3ab0-beae-fb3f6649e8e0",
                                        "entry_id": "3591d72e-c377-37c0-9527-d90b3243927b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Salaire très bas qui ne permet pas de vivre correctement."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "58c34c90-06dc-4aa1-bfa7-6e00a8f1224f",
                                                "sense_id": "83891fcb-a408-3ab0-beae-fb3f6649e8e0",
                                                "text": "Les interventions des ministères de l'Armement des deux pays dans les négociations salariales avaient pour résultat une nette amélioration des salaires féminins qui n'étaient souvent que des salaires de famine avant 1917."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f4240a6a-7db1-4d8e-997a-282e27456e23",
                                                "sense_id": "83891fcb-a408-3ab0-beae-fb3f6649e8e0",
                                                "text": "Pour pouvoir utiliser pleinement leurs forces de travail et surtout pour pouvoir vivre, les paysans pauvres sont obligés de travailler chez les grands propriétaires fonciers à des salaires de famine ou d'affermer ou d'acheter de la terre à des prix très élevés, par quoi une partie du salaire des petits paysans est accaparée par les grands propriétaires fonciers."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "acf50f2e-4358-4c4e-86d5-2acd3a998116",
                        "source_entry_id": "99f7a409-ff47-3daf-8558-493faaef2c44",
